## App-side Required Writes (to satisfy RLS)

When creating a game:
1) Insert `games`
2) Insert `game_members` (creator as editor)
3) Insert `game_clock`
4) Insert `game_officials`
5) Insert `reports` for current user (one per game_official_id)

When recording an incident:
1) Insert `incidents`
2) Insert `incident_targets` for:
   - match-level OR one official OR multiple officials

Preliminary report save:
- Create/update `report_ai_drafts` only when "Regenerate" is tapped (or first run)

Submit / Re-submit:
- Update `reports.status='submitted'`
- Update `submitted_at=now()`
- Increment `version` on re-submit

