## Storage Path Conventions (MVP)

### incident-audio bucket (private)
Store objects under:
- `{incident_id}/{filename}`

Example:
- `3f2a...-uuid/1700_abc123.m4a`

This makes RLS simple because the first path segment maps to `incidents.id`.

### report-pdfs bucket (private)
Store objects under:
- `{game_id}/{report_id}/v{version}.pdf`

Example:
- `9aa1...-uuid/7bb2...-uuid/v3.pdf`

This makes RLS simple because the first path segment maps to `games.id`.

